subject: perf(providers): parallelize batch validation with bounded concurrency (GAP-P1-11)

Replace sequential for-loop fetch patterns with Promise.allSettled-style
bounded concurrency (limit 5) in two hot paths:

1. test-batch/route.js: for-loop over connectionsToTest replaced by
   runWithConcurrency + testConnectionSafe. All provider connections now
   test in parallel, reporting all failures instead of stopping at first.

2. AddApiKeyModal bulk submit: sequential validate+save per key replaced
   by concurrent worker pool. 10 keys now take ~2s instead of ~20s.

Added runWithConcurrency (bounded semaphore), testConnectionSafe (never
throws), makeErrorResult (consistent error shape). 11 new unit tests
verify parallelism, ordering, bounded concurrency, and error semantics.

All 117 unit tests pass. Next.js build succeeds.

